                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Found the game series originally on the app store and decided to buy the series in the bundle- so here are my thoughts on this game:\n\nConcept is easy to understand; both characters have a secret side to them that they don't show the other, and eventually they find out and get together. Simple, right? The story is fairly easy, the game gives you indications on your choice type.\n\nThe artstyle is quite cute and so are the CG's for the particular routes you end up on and the voice acting also adds to how nice the game and story is.\n\nI enjoyed it for the most part- did I think the price was worth every penny? maybe? maybe not? But it's defenitally a one time kinda game you'd play for the heck of it.",
